{"id":"cdaa5386fcc6122c","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-kucera-positive-pi01-tail.md","title":"随机点在正测有效闭类中有尾部","display":"thm-kucera-positive-pi01-tail — 随机点在正测有效闭类中有尾部","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-kucera-positive-pi01-tail","aliases":["43-thm-kucera-positive-pi01-tail"],"display":"thm-kucera-positive-pi01-tail — 随机点在正测有效闭类中有尾部","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-pi01class]]","[[43-df-measure]]","[[43-df-cylinder]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§11.9 Lemma 11.9.1的n=1、D=∅情形，印刷269，PDF289","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-kucera-positive-pi01-tail"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-kucera-positive-pi01-tail</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kucera-positive-pi01-tail — 随机点在正测有效闭类中有尾部"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11.9 Lemma 11.9.1的n=1、D=∅情形，印刷269，PDF289"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X_{\\ge n}\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X_{\\ge n}\\in2^\\omega\\)</span> 是下式定义的第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个尾序列（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>）。有效闭类、随机性及测度见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8e999d59227f4a28\" href=\"?note=8e999d59227f4a28\" title=\"43-df-measure\">43-df-measure</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 及公平硬币测度采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" href=\"?note=ab1ef7b1cac112c1\" title=\"43-df-cylinder\">43-df-cylinder</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 上的有效闭类谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}\\)</span> 在这里仅是该复合标识的一部分，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" href=\"?note=cc07cf2b9ec0019e\" title=\"43-df-pi01class\">43-df-pi01class</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^\\omega\">\\(2^\\omega\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X_{\\ge n}:=\\{(i,X(n+i)):i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X_{\\ge n}:=\\{(i,X(n+i)):i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}(P)\\land\\mu(P)&gt;0\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;X_{\\ge n}\\in P.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}(P)\\land\\mu(P)&gt;0\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;X_{\\ge n}\\in P.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若每个尾部都在补开集S，取S的前缀自由表示并反复连接，测度按r^k衰减，其中μ(S)&lt;r&lt;1；形成捕捉X的ML检验。</p>\n<p>来源：§11.9 Lemma 11.9.1的n=1、D=∅情形，印刷269，PDF289。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi01class","status":"resolved","id":"cc07cf2b9ec0019e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi01class]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"8e999d59227f4a28","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-measure]]","embed":false},