0_1\\mathrm{Class}$ 是 $\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)$ 上的有效闭类谓词；$\\mathrm{Class}$ 在这里仅是该复合标识的一部分，见 [[43-df-pi01class]]。\n$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}$ 是 $\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)$ 上的有效闭类谓词；$\\mathrm{Class}$ 在这里仅是该复合标识的一部分，见 [[43-df-pi01class]]。\n$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$ 是 $2^\\omega$ 上的布尔谓词，见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\ge n}\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"X_{\\ge n}:=\\{(i,X(n+i)):i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\qquad(n\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi^0_1\\mathrm{Class}(P)\\land\\mu(P)>0\\land\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;X_{\\ge n}\\in P.","display":true}],"bytes":1775,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-259","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-kucera-positive-pi01-tail]] — 随机点在正测有效闭类中有尾部"}],"outgoing":["0586e0fd0301d605","cc07cf2b9ec0019e","8e999d59227f4a28","ab1ef7b1cac112c1"]}